<title>USA: MCB Financial Corp sets stock dividend.</title>
<headline>MCB Financial Corp sets stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>SAN RAFAEL, Calif. 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>MCB Financial Corp . Monday declared a five percent stock dividend payable to shareholders on or about Dec. 20.</p>
<p>The dividend was declared at the November meeting of the Board of Directors to shareholders of record on Dec. 16, 1996. Cash will be paid in lieu of any fractional shares.</p>
